{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781420/extras/135780e940b53e90f385c1b2626c47ab.poster.avif?t=1762046956\" width=960 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781420/extras/135780e940b53e90f385c1b2626c47ab.webm?t=1762046956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781420/extras/135780e940b53e90f385c1b2626c47ab.mp4?t=1762046956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You witnessed humanity\u2019s end from a lunar outpost. After 500 years of cryosleep you awake to a ruined, monster infested  reality.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781420/extras/c2edde87e86f508b67d8bbeeeda410ab.avif?t=1762046956\" width=1224 height=350 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE  ISLAND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into a small hand-crafted Island far from the nuclear reach that once served a safe zone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781420/extras/09ede4c6af432c787e72c6b6a0efc745.avif?t=1762046956\" width=1560 height=368 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE CONTINENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and survive on vast procedural generated lands inspired by the southern Andes landscape.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CO-OP or PVP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781420/extras/6bc0b1c3cb54f0b488f06814c2f3c9a5.poster.avif?t=1762046956\" width=960 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781420/extras/6bc0b1c3cb54f0b488f06814c2f3c9a5.webm?t=1762046956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781420/extras/6bc0b1c3cb54f0b488f06814c2f3c9a5.mp4?t=1762046956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with a friend with local multiplayer (with a controller, or even with just one keyboard!)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE &amp; TRADE<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781420/extras/3a3b0c8ae81bfe5e00565d87ebf8ab20.avif?t=1762046956\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781420/extras_big/3a3b0c8ae81bfe5e00565d87ebf8ab20.webp?t=1762046956 width=1560 height=494 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Killing zombies, collecting resources and trading across different biomes will help you improve your weapons, gear and vehicles for your adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3781420?t=1762046956","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3781420?t=1762046956","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781420/4dba47af79b714517a33b462d6ac2797864b9c46/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762046956","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781420/4dba47af79b714517a33b462d6ac2797864b9c46/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762046956","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{